        "text": "Justice Kennedy asked whether there is a business\u2011records exception for forensic lab reports."
      },
      {
        "attribution": "Justice Scalia",
        "citations": [
          {
            "document_hash": "50ad870ec72f2d84abc1ecd5d19e8c1e8f31b58f71e35ecaf253be96530425be",
            "evidence_ids": [
