            "pages": {
              "end": 23,
              "start": 23
            }
          }
        ],
        "text": "According to Justice Scalia, justice Scalia inquired about the historical basis of the Confrontation Clause and whether a business\u2011records exception existed historically."
      },
      {
        "attribution": "Justice Kennedy",
        "citations": [
          {
            "document_hash": "50ad870ec72f2d84abc1ecd5d19e8c1e8f31b58f71e35ecaf253be96530425be",
