            "pages": {
              "end": 38,
              "start": 38
            }
          }
        ],
        "text": "According to Justice Kennedy, justice Kennedy questioned whether the involvement of a machine versus an expert affects the rule for admissibility."
      },
      {
        "attribution": "Justice Kennedy",
        "citations": [
          {
            "document_hash": "50ad870ec72f2d84abc1ecd5d19e8c1e8f31b58f71e35ecaf253be96530425be",
